en.report:
{{title}}

Write a {{kind}} from the research records of the last {{days}} days below, and save it with save_report. Requirements:
- End every fact, result or conclusion with a citation of the supporting record as [#first 8 characters of its ID], for example [#1a2b3c4d]. Content without a supporting record must not be stated as a conclusion; put it under open questions or items to verify.
- Separate done from planned and verified from unreviewed agent content; report failures and negative results honestly.
- Only read and record; do not run commands or change other files. If saving fails, fix the citations as the error says and retry.
